--- .gitignore (原始)
```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Environment
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
target/
```

